<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" pages="3">
  <diagram name="main" id="8vRMg3rPNvjT32dI4wGg">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1600" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nautonumber\n\ntitle Traffic Perception &amp; Acquisition\n\nactor \&quot;Video Stream Input (Lane_idx)\&quot; as RTSP\nparticipant \&quot;StreamWorker [lane_idx]\&quot; as WRK\nqueue \&quot;Frame Queue [lane_idx]\&quot; as Q\nparticipant InferenceEngine as ENG\nparticipant TrafficAnalyzer as ANZ\nparticipant OpenCVLaneViewer as MLV\nparticipant SnapshotPublisher as PUB\nqueue \&quot;SnapshotQueue\&quot; as EXT\nparticipant HealthMonitor as HR\nactor LaunchManager as LCM\nparticipant Logger as LOG\nparticipant LogAnalyzer as LAna\nactor Manager as User\n\n\nnote over RTSP, EXT: [Asynchronous Hybrid Pipeline Architecture - CPU Round-Robin Inference]\n\n&#39; =========================================================================\n&#39; == TẦNG PRODUCER: VÒNG LẶP ĐỚP HÌNH VÀ NẠP QUEUE (CHẠY ĐỘC LẬP THEO LÀN) ==\n&#39; =========================================================================\npar lane_idx == 0\n  loop while frameCaptureTimer_ms % 15 == 0\n    activate RTSP\n    WRK -&gt;&gt; RTSP: captureFrame()\n    deactivate RTSP\n    \n    activate WRK\n    note over WRK: Generate t_start &amp; pack into frameData\\n(LaneID, RawFrame, t_start)\n  \n    WRK -&gt;&gt; Q: enqueue(frameData)\n    deactivate WRK\n    activate Q\n    note over Q: Size = 1 (Overwrite oldest frame\\nto maintain freshness on CPU)\n    deactivate Q\nend\nelse lane_idx == 1\n  loop while frameCaptureTimer_ms % 15 == 0\n    activate RTSP\n    RTSP -&gt;&gt; WRK: captureFrame()\n    deactivate RTSP\n    \n    activate WRK  \n    WRK -&gt;&gt; Q: enqueue(frameData)\n    deactivate WRK\n    activate Q\n    deactivate Q\n  end\nelse lane_idx == 2\n  loop while frameCaptureTimer_ms % 15 == 0\n    activate RTSP\n    RTSP -&gt;&gt; WRK: captureFrame()\n    deactivate RTSP\n    \n    activate WRK  \n    WRK -&gt;&gt; Q: enqueue(frameData)\n    deactivate WRK\n    activate Q\n    deactivate Q\n  end\nelse lane_idx == 3\n  loop while frameCaptureTimer_ms % 15 == 0\n    activate RTSP\n    RTSP -&gt;&gt; WRK: captureFrame()\n    deactivate RTSP\n    \n    activate WRK  \n    WRK -&gt;&gt; Q: enqueue(frameData)\n    deactivate WRK\n    activate Q\n  end\nend\n\n\n&#39; =========================================================================\n&#39; == TẦNG CONSUMER: ENGINE AI CHẠY VÒNG LẶP QUÉT VÒNG TRÒN 4 QUEUE       ==\n&#39; =========================================================================\nloop while running == true\nENG -&gt; Q: dequeue()\nactivate ENG\n\nalt Queue [lane_dx] has data (Frame available)\n  Q --&gt; ENG: allFrameData\n  deactivate Q\n\n    ENG -&gt;&gt; HR: sendStartExecutionSignal\n    activate HR\n  \n  ENG -&gt; ENG: executeInference()\n  activate ENG\n  note over ENG: Append t_infer to FrameMetadata\n  deactivate ENG\n\n  ENG -&gt;&gt; ANZ: forwardDetections(detectionData)\n  deactivate ENG\n  activate ANZ\n\n  ANZ -&gt; ANZ: trackAndAnalyze()\n  activate ANZ\n  note over ANZ: Append t_analyze to FrameMetadata\\nand draw annotations to Frame\n  deactivate ANZ\n\n  &#39; ---- TẦNG UI VISUALIZATION: Cập nhật giao diện đa làn ----\n  ANZ -&gt;&gt; MLV: updateLaneView(laneId, annotatedFrame)\n  activate MLV\n  alt updateLaneView SUCCESS\n    note over MLV: Refresh 2x2 grid window\\nvia cv::imshow()\n    activate User\n    MLV -&gt;&gt; User: showLaneView(laneID)\n    deactivate MLV\n    deactivate User\n\n    activate PUB\n    ANZ -&gt;&gt; PUB: forwardLaneMetrics(laneMetrics)\n    deactivate ANZ\n    deactivate PUB\n  else updateLaneView FAILED\n    MLV -&gt;&gt; LOG: logError(errorCtx)\n    activate MLV\n    activate LOG\n    LOG --&gt;&gt; User: Error Log\n    activate User\n    deactivate LOG\n    MLV -&gt;&gt; User: showError(errorCtx)\n    deactivate MLV\n    deactivate User\n  end\nelse Queue [lane_idx] is empty (No new frame)\n  Q --&gt;&gt; ENG: null / skip\n  activate Q\n  deactivate Q\n  activate ENG\n  deactivate ENG \nend\n\nPUB -&gt;&gt; EXT: broadcastSnapshot(trafficSnapshot)\nactivate PUB\nactivate EXT\ndeactivate EXT\n\n&#39; ---- TẦNG TELEMETRY: Thu thập Metric ----\n\nPUB -&gt;&gt; PUB: calculateTelemetryMetadata(Status: SUCCESS)\n  activate PUB\n  deactivate PUB\nnote over PUB: Compute End-to-End Latency\\n&amp; Formulate Metric Struct\nPUB -&gt;&gt; LOG: logs(TelemetryData)\nactivate LOG\nLOG -&gt;&gt; LOG: store(TelemetryData)\n  activate LOG\n  deactivate LOG \ndeactivate LOG \nPUB -&gt;&gt; HR: sendEndExecutionSignal\ndeactivate PUB\nHR -&gt;&gt; LCM: AliveNotification\ndeactivate HR\n\nopt not in RT hot path\n  activate LOG\n  LOG -&gt;&gt; LOG: dumpLog()\n    activate LOG\n    deactivate LOG\n  activate LAna\n  LAna -&gt; LOG: getLog()\n  LOG --&gt;&gt; LAna: Logs\n  deactivate LOG\n  LAna -&gt;&gt; LAna: analyze()\n    activate LAna\n    deactivate LAna\n  LAna --&gt;&gt; User: analyzedData\n  deactivate LAna\nend\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="q0BarjuReHYYnT5FNkzX-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
