  <diagram id="EqUwnukwaSoHSukEjMQe" name="watchdog">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nautonumber\n\ntitle StreamWatchdog\n\nparticipant StreamWatchdog as WDG\nparticipant \&quot;StreamWorker [lane]\&quot; as WRK\n\nnote over WDG, WRK: [Asynchronous Background Loop for 4 Streams]\n\n&#39; Kích hoạt thanh dọc cho Watchdog vì nó là Background Thread chạy suốt cuộc chơi\nactivate WDG\n\nloop while checkHealthTimer_ms % 5 == 0\nloop for lane in lanes (0..4)\n    &#39; Watchdog chủ động gọi hàm check sức khỏe của Worker làn i\n    WDG -&gt; WRK: checkHealth()\n    activate WRK \n    \n    alt Worker [lane] is Active\n        &#39; Trả về trạng thái OK, tắt lifeline của Worker\n        WRK --&gt;&gt; WDG: returnHealthStatus(STATUS_OK)\n        deactivate WRK\n    else Worker [lane] is Frozen\n        &#39; Trả về trạng thái lỗi / timeout\n        WRK --&gt;&gt; WDG: returnHealthStatus(STATUS_CRITICAL)\n        activate WRK \n        \n        &#39; Watchdog ra lệnh restart đích danh Worker làn i\n        WDG -&gt;&gt; WRK: restartStream()\n        deactivate WRK\n        note over WRK: StreamWorker [i] resets buffer\\n&amp; reconnects its RTSP URL\n    end\nend\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="jdIXKyav3jyCrYU3FpyK-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="421" width="507" x="40" y="40" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
